Orbis: version resource of orbis.exe, private_browsing.exe and plugin-container.exe.

CompanyName Mozilla Corporation becomes Orbis, and LegalTrademarks ("Firefox is a Trademark of The
Mozilla Foundation." in browser/app and pbproxy, the create_rc.py default "Mozilla" in ipc/app) becomes
empty. The key must be present: without it, config/create_rc.py writes its default, "Mozilla".
FileDescription and ProductName already come from MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME (Orbis).
ipc/app/module.ver has CRLF line endings upstream; this patch keeps them. See docs/PATCHES.md.

diff --git a/browser/app/module.ver b/browser/app/module.ver
index 5ef8d2a..1cda1a4 100644
--- a/browser/app/module.ver
+++ b/browser/app/module.ver
@@ -1,8 +1,8 @@
-WIN32_MODULE_COMPANYNAME=Mozilla Corporation
+WIN32_MODULE_COMPANYNAME=Orbis
 WIN32_MODULE_COPYRIGHT=©Firefox and Mozilla Developers; available under the MPL 2 license.
 WIN32_MODULE_PRODUCTVERSION=@MOZ_APP_WINVERSION@
 WIN32_MODULE_PRODUCTVERSION_STRING=@MOZ_APP_VERSION@
-WIN32_MODULE_TRADEMARKS=Firefox is a Trademark of The Mozilla Foundation.
+WIN32_MODULE_TRADEMARKS=
 WIN32_MODULE_DESCRIPTION=@MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME@
 WIN32_MODULE_PRODUCTNAME=@MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME@
 WIN32_MODULE_NAME=@MOZ_APP_DISPLAYNAME@
